if you are watching this video right now  then I am sure that you are someone  interested in learning psychology  here are the list of books that will  help you understand human psychology  better  one  influence science and practice  by Robert Ciel deeney  for readers of any age this book is a  must read  it explains all the methods of  persuasion used by people on a daily  basis and how many are completely  unaware of them  reciprocation commitment consistency  social proof liking Authority and  scarcity are the six tools of persuasion  that are covered in this book  while reading the book one will be  easily able to relate it to their  everyday life and see how people use  these tools to manipulate us  if you want to understand how influence  works this book is for you  2.  Thinking Fast and Slow  by Daniel Kahneman  Thinking Fast and Slow is one of the  best psychology books ever published  the life work of Nobel prize winning  psychologist Daniel Kahneman it outlines  better than anything else the ways in  which humans fool themselves and how our  thoughts influence our Behavior  this book shows you how two systems in  our brain are constantly fighting over  control of our behavior and actions and  teaches you the many ways in which this  leads to errors in memory judgment and  decisions and what we can do about it  three  The Art of Seduction  by Robert Greene  written in Robert Greene's typical style  of demonstrating Universal principles  via historical examples this book is  both entertaining and informative  not only a book about sexual seduction  but rather a universal guide on  seduction in the most general terms  whether it be politically socially or  otherwise it's a book that should be  read by all  not only you will understand yourself  and your relationships but applying  these principles will help you across  your personal and professional lives  4.  flow the psychology of optimal  experience  by mihai six sent mahali  this book explores how we can experience  enjoyment in our lives by controlling  our attention and strengthening our  resolve  this is achieved by being immersed in an  activity or subject that makes us  neither anxious nor bored  in this Flow State we lose our  self-consciousness selfishness and sense  of time  using goal setting and immediate  feedback we can achieve a state of flow  that improves our relationship with work  increases our self-worth and gives our  lives meaning  five  rules for life an antidote to chaos  by Jordan Peterson  this book is everything you expect from  Peterson and more  crafted as a self-help style book it  beautifully interweaves history religion  science and philosophy into a highly  pragmatic book on how to be a fulfilled  successful better human being  it is entertaining self-help manual for  young people that lays out a set of  simple principles that can help us  become more disciplined behave better  act with integrity and balance Our Lives  while enjoying them as much as we can  thank you for watching
 

